	quest.1638D7158F9FF1A8.quest_desc: ["I am ediakith, this is my first time trying to put together a modpack that revolves around vanilla mechanics but with some extened features to make the \"2 week phase\" a tad bit longer i've gone for some simple storage mods and the only \"technical\" mod is and and only gonna be create just because things like nuclear plants, cars and FE doesn't fit in this pack, my goal with the pack is for complete beginners and hardcore veterans to have a chance to come together and play minecraft the way i think is the most fun and simple way about it. A complete questline will be present in the future but for now i just wanted to try to publish the pack and let people review it and see how the response is."]
	quest.1638D7158F9FF1A8.quest_subtitle: "&bHello players"
